 texture of the velvet dress, creates a balanced and harmonious visual effect.", "An American girl, This photograph features a young Asian woman with a delicate, fair complexion and soft, feminine features. She has dark brown, slightly wavy hair that is partially tied up with a small, green and white flower tucked behind her ear. Her right arm is raised, with her hand gently touching her hair, while her left hand is placed near her neck, fingers lightly curled. She is wearing a black, short-sleeved top with a white, collared shirt peeking out from underneath. Her lips are slightly parted, and she is holding a small, black, rectangular object, possibly a piece of candy or a small accessory, in her mouth. Her eyes are large and almond-shaped, with subtle, natural-looking makeup that enhances their shape and gives a soft, glowing effect to her skin. The background is a plain, light beige wall, which keeps the focus on her. The image has a soft, almost ethereal quality, with a gentle light source that highlights her facial features and the texture of her hair and clothing. The overall style of the photograph is modern and minimalist, emphasizing the subject's natural beauty and relaxed, yet slightly playful, pose."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 188, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [571.206298828125, 375.9859619140625], "pos": [-620.0239868164062, 1187.4539794921875], "id": 84, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "1.2.3", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [182, 188], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["append", "yes", "", "", "", "An American girl, This photograph features a young Asian woman with a delicate, fair complexion and soft, feminine features. She has dark b